"text": "Prospects find you on LinkedIn, read three posts, then look for how to hire you. Nothing.\n\nWhat a coach website needs:\n1. Packages with honest prices\n2. A clear way to book a first call\n3. Your approach before your CV\n4. Testimonials with a name and city\n\n📌 Send this to someone who runs a small business.\n\nTry it with one sentence: free preview, no sign-up, about 30 seconds. Pay only if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#coachingbusiness #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
