"text": "A website prompt for a wedding photographer. Copy it and change the details:\n\n\"Wedding photographer in Bodrum, Turkey. Airy, candid, warm film tones. Shoots outdoor weddings on the coast, never a posed group shot. Selected weddings, starting price, style note, contact.\"\n\nWho and where, the mood, what's different, what to show. Write it in your own language: the copy follows it.\n\n📌 Save this for later.\n\nFree preview, no sign-up, about 30 seconds. You only pay if you publish. Link in bio.\n\n#weddingphotographer #smallbusiness #websitedesign #smallbusinesstips #websitebuilder",
